# Engine run outputs and market data never go into git (the engine's CLAUDE.md rule 7). A small
# test fixture CSV can be added with `git add -f`; scripts/check_repo.sh (pre-commit hook and
# flutter test) rejects data-sized ones and per-M1 equity files.
runs/
*.csv
